# Gate-template substitution tooling. The broad `scripts` pattern (line ~595) would
# otherwise exclude these, leaving package.json's `postbuild` hook pointing at a file
# that exists only on the author's machine — the build would hard-fail for every
# teammate, in CI, and on the public mirror. Added 2026-08-04 with spec
# the 2026-08-04 gate-template substitution spec (see .kiro/specs/).
!modules/cms_ui/source/frontend/scripts/
!modules/cms_ui/source/frontend/scripts/substitute-gate-template.js
!modules/cms_ui/source/frontend/scripts/tests/
!modules/cms_ui/source/frontend/scripts/tests/substitute-gate-template.test.js

# iOS XCTest-target generator. Same trap as the gate-template tooling above: the
# broad `scripts` pattern would exclude it, and this script IS the reproducible
# form of the project surgery that creates the MeridianMotorsCompanionTests target. Losing it
# means the next person hand-edits project.pbxproj — which spec
# 2026-08-04-zone2-ipad-adaptive-kiosk-and-xctest calls "the single most fragile
# task in the spec" and explicitly wants to avoid.
#
# The three lines are load-bearing in order and none is redundant: git will not
# consider a file inside an excluded directory, so the directory must be
# re-included first; that alone would expose every sibling, so contents are
# re-excluded; then the one wanted file is re-included. The siblings
# (build_ios_simulator_app.sh, generate-demo-clips.py, install_ios_sim_demo_app.sh)
# stay excluded deliberately — reversing their status is not this spec's call, and
# this repo is publicly mirrored. Added 2026-08-11.
!clients/ios/scripts/
clients/ios/scripts/*
!clients/ios/scripts/add-xctest-target.rb
# Launch-splash + brand-asset tooling, same rationale as add-xctest-target.rb above.
#
# add-splash-screen.rb registers the splash sources, the .mp4 and the launch
# storyboard with the project; make-brand-assets.swift derives the cropped
# wordmark and the app icon from the art-sources master. Both are referenced by
# name from clients/ios/README.md and art-sources/meridian/README.md, so leaving
# them excluded would ship instructions pointing at files a fresh clone does not
# have.
#
# make-brand-assets.swift is the only record of three non-obvious decisions that
# cannot be recovered from the PNGs it emits: the 0.30 luminance floor that
# excludes the master's corner artifact, the 34px gap rule that splits the
# wordmark at its pipe, and the single shared scale factor that keeps stroke
# weight matched across the icon's two lines. Added 2026-08-20.
!clients/ios/scripts/add-splash-screen.rb
!clients/ios/scripts/make-brand-assets.swift
modules/predictive_agent
